@*
=========================================================
FILE: Routes.razor

PURPOSE:
Routing for the public site; unknown addresses show the not-found page.

IMPORTANT NOTES:
- Static server rendering (D-U1): no interactive render mode
- Text comes from PublicText (UI-10); Frontend/UI restyles it
=========================================================
*@
<Router AppAssembly="typeof(Program).Assembly" NotFoundPage="typeof(Pages.NotFoundPage)">
    <Found Context="routeData">
        <RouteView RouteData="routeData" DefaultLayout="typeof(PublicLayout)" />
    </Found>
</Router>
